 n Samantha Kira\, Talia Sporkin\, and Ava Rush for a night of heartfelt so
 ngwriting\, catchy melodies\, and genre-blending sounds. Bringing together
  roots-rock\, pop\, country\, and folk influences\, these three singer-son
 gwriters offer unique perspectives on love\, heartbreak\, growing up\, and
  everything in between. From powerful vocals and energetic instrumentals t
 o intimate storytelling and cheeky lyricism\, this is a show full of raw e
 motion\, relatable lyrics\, and plenty of personality.\nhttps://www.lilypa
 dinman.com/home/2026/11/3/songs-and-stories-ava-rush-talia-sporkin-samanth
