SUMMARY:Lilypad Jazz Jam
LOCATION:The Lilypad\, 1353 Cambridge St\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:$5 - 15 sliding scale admission / 4 - 7pm / all ages We're exci
 ted to be welcoming the community into our space to play and listen to mus
 ic together. The Lilypad Jazz Jam is open to instrumentalists of all level
 s\, we only ask that you come prepared to play at least one or two well kn
 own Jazz Standards in the commonly played key. And of course listeners are
  welcome to come and enjoy the music these spontaneously arranged ensemble
 s will create! Our host will be working with players to make sure everyone
  gets a chance to get on stage and play something they're comfortable with
 . We'll have a drum kit\, piano\, upright bass and guitar/bass amplifiers 
 on the back line. Our stage hosts some of the heaviest players on the plan
 et\, come down and catch the vibe!\nhttps://www.lilypadinman.com/home/2026
 /lilypad-jazz-jam-s4xyd\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.lilypadinman.com/home/2026/lilypad-jazz-jam-s4xyd
END:VEVENT
